# Keep it out of this ordinary-user test configuration and all NEXT_PUBLIC_ variables.
# Password recovery dispatch stays disabled until SMTP/template and an authorized test recipient exist.
# In .staging/server.env only: RECOVERY_EMAIL_ENABLED=yes and RECOVERY_ALLOWED_EMAILS=authorized-address
